---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cosmetic Peptide Raw Materials for Formulators — GHK-Cu, AHK-Cu, Glutathione" description="Cosmetic peptide raw materials for formulators: GHK-Cu, AHK-Cu and glutathione with identity, purity, colour, counter-ion and compatibility data for formulation research." canonical="/applications/formulators/">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Applications › Formulators</p>
    <h1>Cosmetic peptide raw materials for formulators</h1>
    <div class="quick-answer"><strong>Quick answer.</strong> Formulators need more than a purity number: identity, counter-ion, water content, colour range and microbial status decide whether a raw material fits the formula. For copper peptides, colour is part of the specification.</div>
    <p class="lead muted">We supply cosmetic peptide raw materials to formulators and brands that need a documented starting point — not a grade label and a hope.</p>

    <h2>What we supply</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Material</th><th>Key attributes to verify</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>GHK-Cu</td><td>Identity, peptide purity, copper content, colour range, counter-ion</td></tr>
        <tr><td>AHK-Cu</td><td>Identity (AHK sequence, not GHK), copper content, colour</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Glutathione</td><td>Reduced form (GSH), GSSG content, water, appearance</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Formulation questions we can answer</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Recommended pH window for the copper complex</li>
      <li>Counter-ion and its effect on mass and compatibility</li>
      <li>Colour range to expect at the intended concentration</li>
      <li>Packaging and storage recommendations</li>
      <li>Documentation available for your technical file</li>
    </ul>
    <p>What we cannot answer is whether a raw material is compatible with your finished formula — that requires your compatibility testing. See <a href="/knowledge/ghk-cu-formulation-notes/">GHK-Cu formulation notes</a> and <a href="/knowledge/cosmetic-peptide-raw-materials-framework/">the cosmetic pillar</a>.</p>

    <h2>Documentation package</h2>
    <p>Each lot can ship with a COA covering identity, purity, water and appearance; copper content where applicable; and an MSDS. Microbial testing is available on request with the method stated. If a supplier cannot tell you the method behind a microbial claim, treat the claim as unverified.</p>

    <h2>Start with a sample</h2>
    <p>For a new material, order a sample and run your compatibility matrix before committing to a bulk lot. The sample's COA batch number should match the shipment you later receive.</p>

    <p><a class="btn" href="/products/cosmetic/">Cosmetic peptide range</a> <a class="wa-btn" href={site.whatsappLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="margin-left:10px;">💬 WhatsApp</a></p>
    <div class="ruo">{site.ruo} No cosmetic efficacy claim is made.</div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
